# the Pattern page (SEQ three times): five lanes on the white keys, the Sequence's and Sequence 2's steps, their
# octaves, the Sequence's skips; the first edit takes the pattern over from Auto (Play: Pattern); a black key held with a
# white one: an accent; a lane's chance and accents are its sequence's
wait 300
listen
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 16
said Pattern page, voice Moog: Lane Steps, Accent 50, Chance 100%, Play Auto
expect par105 0
tapkey w1
wait 300
expect par105 1
said Step 2
tapkey w1
wait 300
said Step 2
# the Skips lane: empty in Auto (the performer hasn't moved yet), one step skipped
spin K1 4
wait 300
said Lane Skips
expect par93 0
tapkey w2
wait 300
expect par93 4
# a lane's chance is its sequence's: Octaves 2 is Sequence 2's (par100), not a slot of its own
spin K1 -1
wait 300
said Lane Octaves 2
spin K3 -30
wait 300
expect par100 70
expect par99 100
